oreground/60 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest tabular-nums">02</span><h3 class="text-foreground truncate text-[15px] font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-base">Every tool your company already runs on.</h3></div><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 border-t p-2 flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 px-2 pt-2"><p class="text-muted-foreground text-[13px] leading-relaxed">The repo also holds the connectors. Wire up Slack, docs, tickets, CRM, billing and code once, then scope which agent may touch which one.</p><ul class="text-muted-foreground space-y-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed"><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.4s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.48000000000000004s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.56s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.64s"></div></div><span>3,000+ apps in a click, plus MCP, OpenAPI, Postman, GraphQL and raw HTTP</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.4s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.48000000000000004s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.56s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.64s"></div></div><span>Connector credentials are brokered server-side and never enter the machine</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animat