1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span></span><span class="text-foreground min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[12.5px] leading-tight">Opened a change request</span><span class="shrink-0 text-[10.5px] leading-tight text-muted-foreground/60">for a human to read</span></li></ul><p class="text-muted-foreground/70 border-border border-t pt-2.5 font-mono text-[10.5px]">agents/kortix.md · permission.bash → <span class="text-kortix-red">git push: deny</span></p></div></div></div></div></article><article data-stack-layer="computer" class="border-border bg-popover flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border"><div class="flex w-full items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 sm:px-6"><span class="text-muted-foreground/60 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest tabular-nums">05</span><h3 class="text-foreground truncate text-[15px] font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-base">Every session gets its own computer.</h3></div><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 border-t p-2 flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 px-2 pt-2"><p class="text-muted-foreground text-[13px] leading-relaxed">The harness needs somewhere to run. Each session boots its own isolated Linux machine with your repo and your tools already on it — nothing to install, no laptop involved.</p><ul class="text-muted-foreground space-y-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed"><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6800000000000002s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.76s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.84s"></div></div><span>Session id, sandbox id and branch name are one and the same string</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6800000000000002s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.76s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.84s"></div></div><span>The agent can install, run and break anything — only commits survive</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6800000000000002s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.76s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.84s"></div></div><span>Thousands run in parallel with no crossover between them</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex h-[16rem] min-h-0 w-full flex-col sm:h-[19rem]"><div class="h-full w-full"><div class="bg-muted/40 flex h-full min-h-0 flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl p-6 pb-0"><div class="shrink-0 px-5 sm:px-6"></div><div class="mx-auto flex min-h-0 w-[92%] flex-1 flex-col mask-b-from-50%"><div class="border-border bg-background flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-t-xl border border-b-0 px-5 pt-4 shadow-sm sm:px-6 sm:pt-5"></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article data-stack-layer="control-plane" class="border-border bg-popover flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border"><div class="flex w-full items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 sm:px-6"><span class="text-muted-foreground/60 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest tabular-nums">06</span><h3 class="text-foreground truncate text-[15px] font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-base">One place to start it, one gate to land it.</h3></div><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 border-t p-2 flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 px-2 pt-2"><p class="text-muted-foreground text-[13px] leading-relaxed">Start, watch and steer every agent in the organization — from the web app, from Slack, from your terminal, or from nobody at all. Then the work commits back into the repo you started from.</p><ul class="text-muted-foreground space-y-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed"><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.08s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.16s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.24s"></div></div><span>Web, Slack, mobile, CLI and API all start the same session</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.08s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.16s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.24s"></div></div><span>Cron schedules and signed webhooks start sessions with no one asking</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.08s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.16s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.24s"></div></div><span>Session work lands on main as a change request you read as a diff first</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex h-[16rem] min-h-0 w-full flex-col sm:h-[19rem]"><div class="bg-muted/40 relative flex h-full w-full flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="shrink-0 px-5 pt-4 sm:px-8 sm:pt-6"></div><div class="border-border bg-background mx-auto mt-4 flex min-h-0 w-[92%] flex-1 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-t-xl border border-b-0 px-4 pt-4 shadow-sm sm:px-6 sm:pt-5"><div class="mx-auto flex h-full w-full max-w-lg items-center pb-5"></div></div><div role="status" class="sr-only"></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></section>"`;

exports[`desktop retains six ordered panels 1`] = `"<section id="platform-stack" class="relative space-y-24 md:space-y-30"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 pt-[4.75rem] [@media(max-height:860px)]:pt-[4.5rem]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 select-none"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-[0.75rem] leading-none font-normal uppercase select-none" data-text="true">The Kortix stack</span><h2 data-heading="true" class="text-foreground max-w-2xl font-sans text-2xl font-medium text-balance sm:text-3xl">Every layer an AI workforce needs — in one platform you own.</h2></div><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed">Most tools hand you one layer and rent you the rest. Kortix is all six — they read in order, and the sixth commits the work back into the first.</p></div><div class="mx-auto mt-8 w-full max-w-7xl px-6 pb-16"><div class="grid grid-cols-[14rem_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-10 xl:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)]"><nav aria-label="The Kortix stack" class="sticky top-30 flex flex-col gap-1 pt-1"><button type="button" data-stack-layer="source" data-active="true" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="bg-foreground absolute top-1/2 left-0 -mt-2.5 h-5 w-0.5 rounded-full"></span><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground">Source of truth</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="context" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Context &amp; connections</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="models" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Large language models</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="harness" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Agentic harness</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="computer" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Agent computer</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="control-plane" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Control plane</span></button></nav><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-24 xl:gap-30"><div id="stack-pane-source" data-stack-pane="source" class="scroll-mt-30"><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-col space-y-10"><p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-snug tracking-tight text-pretty sm:text-xl"><span class="text-foreground font-medium">One git repo that is the company.</span> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Agents, skills, memory, connector config and triggers are all text in one repo. Not settings in someone else’s database — files you own.</span></p><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 flex h-88 min-h-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border sm:h-112 xl:h-128"><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-full overflow-hidden"><div class="relative hidden h-full w-full lg:block bg-[radial-gradient(circle,color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-border)_45%,transparent)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:16px_16px]"><div aria-hidden="true" class="abso