k commits back into the repo you started from.</span></p><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 flex h-88 min-h-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border sm:h-112 xl:h-128"><div class="bg-muted/40 relative flex h-full w-full flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="shrink-0 px-5 pt-4 sm:px-8 sm:pt-6"></div><div class="border-border bg-background mx-auto mt-4 flex min-h-0 w-[92%] flex-1 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-t-xl border border-b-0 px-4 pt-4 shadow-sm sm:px-6 sm:pt-5"><div class="mx-auto flex h-full w-full max-w-lg items-center pb-5"></div></div><div role="status" class="sr-only"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>"`;
